<title>INDIA: Indian repo auction cut-off unchanged at 3.95 pct.</title>
<headline>Indian repo auction cut-off unchanged at 3.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India said on Friday it maintained the cut-off at 3.95 percent at its repo auction of government securities.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
